apsible-27","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `defaultExpanded` for initial expansion, or `isExpanded` with `onExpandedChange` for controlled\nstate. The callback receives a boolean. Use the Accordion component to coordinate several sections;\nin that composition, manage expansion through the group."},"497":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-28","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"},"498":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-29","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"499":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-30","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"500":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-31","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"501":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"| Key                   | Action                                                              |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift + Tab` | Move between the enabled trigger and controls in the expanded panel |","table":"table-0"},"502":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"| Key               | Action                                         |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` / `Space` | Toggle the section; focus stays on the trigger |","table":"table-0"},"503":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."},"504":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"Set `role=\"region\"` on `CollapsiblePanel` when its content warrants a named landmark\nfor direct screen-reader navigation."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"Collapsed content stays mounted but is excluded from keyboard and screen-reader navigation."},"508":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`Icon sl